        <div class="panel-b md">
          <h1>Hi, I'm Kieran 👋</h1>
          <p>I make small, durable software: things that keep working when the network goes away, the vendor shuts down, or the server bill stops getting paid. Most of what's here is source-available and built to be read as much as run.</p>
          <h2>What I'm working on</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>useful</strong> — an offline-first toolbox (timers, notes, generators, a SQL playground) that lives entirely in the browser.</li>
            <li><strong>frznforge</strong> — this site. A read-only, static forge generator so a single person can showcase repos without hosting a forge.</li>
            <li>Writing about local-first data layers and why "just rebuild the site" is a feature.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2>Stack</h2>
